{"type":"text","timestamp":1794363952788,"sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","part":{"id":"prt_1c86d0e8000146wCMr0dRaLLkU","messageID":"msg_1c86d0164001uxYBVVO84wmYq2","sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","type":"text","text":"<think>Something about the command triggered a rule. Perhaps `touch /tmp/opencode/x`? Hmm, \"The user has specified a rule which prevents you from using this specific tool call\" — it seems external directory access is denied except /tmp/opencode/*... but the first `ls -ld /tmp/opencode` might be the issue since `/tmp/opencode` itself without trailing `/*`. Let me avoid that and just work inside /workspace.\n\nActually the key question: can I install packages? The pip cache is \"read-only\". Let me try `pip install requests --target` inside workspace, or check if there's a local wheel cache. Let's try pip install into a venv in /workspace/.venv.\n\nActually, maybe pip works but the issue is just writing to /tmp/opencode. Let me try `pip download requests -d /workspace/.tmpdl`.\n\nHmm, but the earlier command with `pip download requests -d /tmp/opencode/pipdl` ran and only failed at makedirs. So pip itself didn't error before that. Let me try with a workspace path.\n\nAlso `pip cache dir` might show the read-only cache location.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794363952768,"end":1794363952784}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794363953611,"sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01a1c86d0af5775299e5411c","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"pip download requests -d /workspace/.tmpdl --no-deps -q 2>&1 | tail -5; ls /workspace/.tmpdl 2>/dev/null; pip cache dir 2>&1","workdir":"/workspace"},"output":"requests-2.34.2-py3-none-any.whl\n/tmp/llmlab-deps/pip\n","metadata":{"output":"requests-2.34.2-py3-none-any.whl\n/tmp/llmlab-deps/pip\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"pip download requests -d /workspace/.tmpdl --no-deps -q 2>&1 | tail -5; ls /workspace/.tmpdl 2>/dev/null; pip cache dir 2>&1","time":{"start":1794363952776,"end":1794363953591}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c86d0e83001mP9H2zD21XquYN","sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","messageID":"msg_1c86d0164001uxYBVVO84wmYq2"}}
