{"type":"text","timestamp":1794364159482,"sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","part":{"id":"prt_1c87035e7001xfIvtik94kFAOD","messageID":"msg_1c870255b0011H48JVlmQSsJd9","sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","type":"text","text":"<think>The lock file works but references the temporary constraints file in the comments. Let me clean it up by removing the `-c /workspace/.tmp-constraints.txt` lines and the header (to match the original style which had no header). Let me post-process with python.\n\nActually, a cleaner approach: regenerate with the constraints file stored inside the repo at a permanent path? No — the lock should be reproducible. I'll just strip the \"-c\" reference lines and the header comment.\n\nLet me use a Python script to filter lines.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794364159463,"end":1794364159478}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794364159594,"sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01a1c87030e070d180be2c9c","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"backend/requirements.lock\")\nlines = p.read_text().splitlines()\nout = []\nfor line in lines:\n    if line.strip().startswith(\"#\") and \"tmp-constraints\" in line:\n        continue\n    out.append(line)\n# drop the pip-compile header block\nwhile out and out[0].startswith(\"#\"):\n    out.pop(0)\np.write_text(\"\\n\".join(out) + \"\\n\")\nprint(\"\\n\".join(out[:20]))\nEOF","workdir":"/workspace"},"output":"blinker==1.9.0 \\\n    --hash=sha256:b4ce2265a7abece45e7cc896e98dbebe6cead56bcf805a3d23136d145f5445bf \\\n    --hash=sha256:ba0efaa9080b619ff2f3459d1d500c57bddea4a6b424b60a91141db6fd2f08bc\n    # via\n    #   flask\ncertifi==2026.10.23 \\\n    --hash=sha256:a9895e6e2758b371e0545e321a3a8fd1fcfd9829ada8824a936dfb16aaaf36cd \\\n    --hash=sha256:e9b54de76e530bb6cf0ccd036787103acb58fd42ba930ea8bf948ddbaa2f61d1\n    # via\n    #   requests\ncharset-normalizer==3.5.2 \\\n    --hash=sha256:01077390b03f7988f11d700a2194e69b119741a86b1a638b1db88891e3eced8e \\\n    --hash=sha256:01b0c0d2262a9e28e8484a278c7e1b5d650e3ac8cf2683d2967e25899f208bdf \\\n    --hash=sha256:04851f73ae72b8413dddadb16a49dfee95263553741fd42d546f7d66907e6be5 \\\n    --hash=sha256:0521c5665880b33d603717defa76c094048900010897909952397feb3039da56 \\\n    --hash=sha256:0774bf9bf620249fee3e0b8b9fd3065de213be30f3aa94ce2494b3b638949e26 \\\n    --hash=sha256:0891b9d3903c5571c03771ca669a4b0ec5618ca722a5c957d3d29cd4e5062848 \\\n    --hash=sha256:0c951d5e6dd9c2ff60609476752bee49da4206adde960ebc247766937f72e718 \\\n    --hash=sha256:0fed1d06615f022ee3b13caf5e8b180cfea32bb2c5aded8a9d44277afc040f93 \\\n    --hash=sha256:114e4d0c92d618409ed82a99e22b5c5e768fe995f2973f78265f4524f49d4640 \\\n","metadata":{"output":"blinker==1.9.0 \\\n    --hash=sha256:b4ce2265a7abece45e7cc896e98dbebe6cead56bcf805a3d23136d145f5445bf \\\n    --hash=sha256:ba0efaa9080b619ff2f3459d1d500c57bddea4a6b424b60a91141db6fd2f08bc\n    # via\n    #   flask\ncertifi==2026.10.23 \\\n    --hash=sha256:a9895e6e2758b371e0545e321a3a8fd1fcfd9829ada8824a936dfb16aaaf36cd \\\n    --hash=sha256:e9b54de76e530bb6cf0ccd036787103acb58fd42ba930ea8bf948ddbaa2f61d1\n    # via\n    #   requests\ncharset-normalizer==3.5.2 \\\n    --hash=sha256:01077390b03f7988f11d700a2194e69b119741a86b1a638b1db88891e3eced8e \\\n    --hash=sha256:01b0c0d2262a9e28e8484a278c7e1b5d650e3ac8cf2683d2967e25899f208bdf \\\n    --hash=sha256:04851f73ae72b8413dddadb16a49dfee95263553741fd42d546f7d66907e6be5 \\\n    --hash=sha256:0521c5665880b33d603717defa76c094048900010897909952397feb3039da56 \\\n    --hash=sha256:0774bf9bf620249fee3e0b8b9fd3065de213be30f3aa94ce2494b3b638949e26 \\\n    --hash=sha256:0891b9d3903c5571c03771ca669a4b0ec5618ca722a5c957d3d29cd4e5062848 \\\n    --hash=sha256:0c951d5e6dd9c2ff60609476752bee49da4206adde960ebc247766937f72e718 \\\n    --hash=sha256:0fed1d06615f022ee3b13caf5e8b180cfea32bb2c5aded8a9d44277afc040f93 \\\n    --hash=sha256:114e4d0c92d618409ed82a99e22b5c5e768fe995f2973f78265f4524f49d4640 \\\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"backend/requirements.lock\")\nlines = p.read_text().splitlines()\nout = []\nfor line in lines:\n    if line.strip().startswith(\"#\") and \"tmp-constraints\" in line:\n        continue\n    out.append(line)\n# drop the pip-compile header block\nwhile out and out[0].startswith(\"#\"):\n    out.pop(0)\np.write_text(\"\\n\".join(out) + \"\\n\")\nprint(\"\\n\".join(out[:20]))\nEOF","time":{"start":1794364159472,"end":1794364159522}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c87035ea001do4JgiO3DhZ3eZ","sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","messageID":"msg_1c870255b0011H48JVlmQSsJd9"}}
