{"type":"text","timestamp":1794364584843,"sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","part":{"id":"prt_1c876b36f001boDHfiaXGZioov","messageID":"msg_1c87687f30016TRgXeAS77D11H","sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","type":"text","text":"<think>The first run passed with 0 failures (against a fresh DB where \"alice\" didn't exist... wait, the DB already had alice from the previous run? Let me think: the earlier successful run created alice/bob in data/app.db. Then the test ran again → \"duplicate register 409\" expected 409 → OK, but login works... but the second run reported 3 failures because alice already has previews (total != 3).\n\nSo the test needs a fresh DB. That's expected: the test assumes a clean database. The first run in this invocation passed with 0 failures — meaning the DB was fresh (I did `rm -rf data` before starting gunicorn... but the first server start did `rm -rf data` and created the DB, then the smoke test ran once creating alice... hmm, then the second run in this command failed with 3 failures due to leftover data).\n\nRight. The test is stateful; that's fine — it passes on a clean DB. Let me make the test robust by using unique usernames per run (e.g. a random suffix) and not asserting on global totals. Let me update the test to use unique usernames and count-based assertions relative to the user.\n\nLet me update: use `user = \"alice\" + str(int(time.time()))` etc., and compute expectations relative to that user's own previews (total == 3 after creating 3). Since each user has their own previews, totals are per-user.\n\nLet me applythat change.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794364584815,"end":1794364584838}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794364584914,"sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01a1c876ad41743eaf88eabe","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace && python3 - <<'EOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"tests/smoke_test.py\")\ns = p.read_text()\ns = s.replace('import json\\nimport os\\nimport sys', 'import json\\nimport os\\nimport sys\\nimport time')\ns = s.replace('def main():\\n    server', 'def main():\\n    suffix = str(int(time.time() * 1000))\\n    alice = \"alice\" + suffix\\n    bob = \"bob\" + suffix\\n    server')\ns = s.replace('\"username\": \"alice\"', '\"username\": alice')\ns = s.replace('\"username\": \"bob\"', '\"username\": bob')\ns = s.replace('check(\"total 3\", body[\"total\"] == 3, body[\"total\"])', 'check(\"total 3\", body[\"total\"] == 3, body[\"total\"])')\np.write_text(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"alice\\|bob\" tests/smoke_test.py | head -20","workdir":"/workspace"},"output":"92:    alice = \"alice\" + suffix\n93:    bob = \"bob\" + suffix\n106:    status, body = request(\"POST\", \"/api/auth/register\", {\"username\": alice, \"password\": \"pw123456\"})\n109:    status, body = request(\"POST\", \"/api/auth/register\", {\"username\": alice, \"password\": \"pw123456\"})\n112:    status, body = request(\"POST\", \"/api/auth/login\", {\"username\": alice, \"password\": \"wrong\"})\n115:    status, body = request(\"POST\", \"/api/auth/login\", {\"username\": alice, \"password\": \"pw123456\"})\n167:    request(\"POST\", \"/api/auth/register\", {\"username\": bob, \"password\": \"pw123456\"})\n168:    status, body = request(\"POST\", \"/api/auth/login\", {\"username\": bob, \"password\": \"pw123456\"})\n169:    bob = body[\"token\"]\n170:    status, body = request(\"GET\", \"/api/previews\", token=bob)\n171:    check(\"bob sees nothing\", status == 200 and body[\"total\"] == 0, f\"{status} {body}\")\n172:    status, body = request(\"GET\", f\"/api/previews/{preview['id']}\", token=bob)\n173:    check(\"bob cannot read alice preview\", status == 404, f\"{status} {body}\")\n174:    status, body = request(\"POST\", f\"/api/previews/{preview['id']}/refresh\", token=bob)\n175:    check(\"bob cannot refresh alice preview\", status == 404, f\"{status} {body}\")\n176:    status, body = request(\"DELETE\", f\"/api/previews/{preview['id']}\", token=bob)\n177:    check(\"bob cannot delete alice preview\", status == 404, f\"{status} {body}\")\n","metadata":{"output":"92:    alice = \"alice\" + suffix\n93:    bob = \"bob\" + suffix\n106:    status, body = request(\"POST\", \"/api/auth/register\", {\"username\": alice, \"password\": \"pw123456\"})\n109:    status, body = request(\"POST\", \"/api/auth/register\", {\"username\": alice, \"password\": \"pw123456\"})\n112:    status, body = request(\"POST\", \"/api/auth/login\", {\"username\": alice, \"password\": \"wrong\"})\n115:    status, body = request(\"POST\", \"/api/auth/login\", {\"username\": alice, \"password\": \"pw123456\"})\n167:    request(\"POST\", \"/api/auth/register\", {\"username\": bob, \"password\": \"pw123456\"})\n168:    status, body = request(\"POST\", \"/api/auth/login\", {\"username\": bob, \"password\": \"pw123456\"})\n169:    bob = body[\"token\"]\n170:    status, body = request(\"GET\", \"/api/previews\", token=bob)\n171:    check(\"bob sees nothing\", status == 200 and body[\"total\"] == 0, f\"{status} {body}\")\n172:    status, body = request(\"GET\", f\"/api/previews/{preview['id']}\", token=bob)\n173:    check(\"bob cannot read alice preview\", status == 404, f\"{status} {body}\")\n174:    status, body = request(\"POST\", f\"/api/previews/{preview['id']}/refresh\", token=bob)\n175:    check(\"bob cannot refresh alice preview\", status == 404, f\"{status} {body}\")\n176:    status, body = request(\"DELETE\", f\"/api/previews/{preview['id']}\", token=bob)\n177:    check(\"bob cannot delete alice preview\", status == 404, f\"{status} {body}\")\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace && python3 - <<'EOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"tests/smoke_test.py\")\ns = p.read_text()\ns = s.replace('import json\\nimport os\\nimport sys', 'import json\\nimport os\\nimport sys\\nimport time')\ns = s.replace('def main():\\n    server', 'def main():\\n    suffix = str(int(time.time() * 1000))\\n    alice = \"alice\" + suffix\\n    bob = \"bob\" + suffix\\n    server')\ns = s.replace('\"username\": \"alice\"', '\"username\": alice')\ns = s.replace('\"username\": \"bob\"', '\"username\": bob')\ns = s.replace('check(\"total 3\", body[\"total\"] == 3, body[\"total\"])', 'check(\"total 3\", body[\"total\"] == 3, body[\"total\"])')\np.write_text(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"alice\\|bob\" tests/smoke_test.py | head -20","time":{"start":1794364584824,"end":1794364584899}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c876b372001LPi5RbqhqoUwXn","sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","messageID":"msg_1c87687f30016TRgXeAS77D11H"}}
