{"type":"text","timestamp":1794364640500,"sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","part":{"id":"prt_1c8778ccd001wV6hbjnqlGU7Tr","messageID":"msg_1c8777cd4001isDiQ8p51ruOgg","sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","type":"text","text":"<think>Note the version specifiers: the existing deps are pinned exactly (\"react\": \"19.3.1\", \"vite\": \"8.3.5\"), but my install used \"^4.3.5\". Let me pin them exactly to match the repo convention: \"tailwindcss\": \"4.3.5\", \"@tailwindcss/vite\": \"4.3.5\". Then re-run npm install to update the lock file.\n\nLet me edit package.json and run npm installagain.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794364640461,"end":1794364640492}}}
