{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794364745415,"sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","part":{"id":"prt_1c87926b1001EjnEzs2zrwhPIK","messageID":"msg_1c878fd79001yMds7MLPms6bbo","sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794364745415,"sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","part":{"id":"prt_1c87926b50016gWCOMwWdsbLcX","messageID":"msg_1c878fd79001yMds7MLPms6bbo","sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","type":"text","text":"<think>Now the Dashboard component and App.\n\nDashboard:\n```tsx\ntype DashboardProps = { session: Session; onSignOut: () => void };\n\nexport default function Dashboard({session, onSignOut}) {\n  const [previews, setPreviews] = useState<Preview[]>([]);\n  const [total, setTotal] = useState(0);\n  const [page, setPage] = useState(1);\n  const [pageSize, setPageSize] = useState(10);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<string|null>(null);\n\n  const load = useCallback(async (targetPage: number, size: number) => {...}, []);\n\n  useEffect(() => { void load(page, pageSize); }, [load, page, pageSize]);\n  ...\n}\n```\n\nHandling 401 → sign out. I'll pass an `onUnauthorized` callback to App which clears the session.\n\nAdd: when a preview is added, if page === 1 → reload list (to keep ordering) or prepend to the list. Simplest: after adding, call load(1, pageSize) to refresh the list from the server (newest first). I'll do that: onAdded → setPage(1) and reload.\n\nRefresh: update the item in the current list (replace by id).\n\nDelete: remove from the list, decrement total, and if the current page becomes empty and page > 1 → go back a page.\n\nLet me write it.\n\nAlso the header: app title \"Link previews\", the signed-in username, and a \"Sign out\" button.\n\nLet me write the Dashboard.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794364745397,"end":1794364745411}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794364745442,"sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01a1c87910bc711b910bb6dc","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import { useCallback, useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { ApiError, api } from \"../api\";\nimport type { Preview, Session } from \"../types\";\nimport AddLinkForm from \"./AddLinkForm\";\nimport Pagination from \"./Pagination\";\nimport PreviewCard from \"./PreviewCard\";\n\ntype DashboardProps = {\n  session: Session;\n  onSignOut: () => void;\n  onUnauthorized: () => void;\n};\n\nexport default function Dashboard({ session, onSignOut, onUnauthorized }: DashboardProps) {\n  const [previews, setPreviews] = useState<Preview[]>([]);\n  const [total, setTotal] = useState(0);\n  const [page, setPage] = useState(1);\n  const [pageSize, setPageSize] = useState(10);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n\n  const load = useCallback(\n    async (targetPage: number, size: number) => {\n      setLoading(true);\n      try {\n        const result = await api.listPreviews(targetPage, size);\n        setPreviews(result.items);\n        setTotal(result.total);\n        setError(null);\n      } catch (caught) {\n        if (caught instanceof ApiError && caught.status === 401) {\n          onUnauthorized();\n          return;\n        }\n        setError(caught instanceof Error ? caught.message : \"Could not load your saved links.\");\n      } finally {\n        setLoading(false);\n      }\n    },\n    [onUnauthorized],\n  );\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    void load(page, pageSize);\n  }, [load, page, pageSize]);\n\n  function handleAdded() {\n    setPage(1);\n    void load(1, pageSize);\n  }\n\n  function handleUpdated(updated: Preview) {\n    setPreviews((current) =>\n      current.map((item) => (item.id === updated.id ? updated : item)),\n    );\n  }\n\n  function handleDeleted(id: number) {\n    setPreviews((current) => current.filter((item) => item.id !== id));\n    setTotal((current) => Math.max(0, current - 1));\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-50\">\n      <header className=\"border-b border-slate-200 bg-white\">\n        <div className=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-4xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4\">\n          <h1 className=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Link previews</h1>\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <span className=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">\n              Signed in as{\" \"}\n              <span className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">{session.username}</span>\n            </span>\n            <button\n              type=\"button\"\n              onClick={onSignOut}\n              title=\"Sign out\"\n              className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 transition hover:border-rose-300 hover:text-rose-600\"\n            >\n              Sign out\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      <main className=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl space-y-6 px-4 py-8\">\n        <AddLinkForm onAdded={handleAdded} />\n\n        {error ? (\n          <p role=\"alert\" className=\"rounded-xl bg-rose-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-rose-700\">\n            {error}\n          </p>\n        ) : null}\n\n        {loading && previews.length === 0 ? (\n          <p className=\"py-8 text-center text-sm text-slate-500\">Loading your saved links…</p>\n        ) : null}\n\n        {!loading && previews.length === 0 ? (\n          <div className=\"rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-white px-6 py-12 text-center\">\n            <p className=\"text-base font-medium text-slate-700\">No links saved yet</p>\n            <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">\n              Paste a link above to create your first preview.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        ) : null}\n\n        <section className=\"space-y-4\">\n          {previews.map((preview) => (\n            <PreviewCard\n              key={preview.id}\n              preview={preview}\n              onUpdated={handleUpdated}\n              onDeleted={handleDeleted}\n            />\n          ))}\n        </section>\n\n        <Pagination\n          page={page}\n          pageSize={pageSize}\n          total={total}\n          onPageChange={setPage}\n          onPageSizeChange={(size) => {\n            setPageSize(size);\n            setPage(1);\n          }}\n        />\n      </main>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/Dashboard.tsx"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/Dashboard.tsx","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/components/Dashboard.tsx","time":{"start":1794364745406,"end":1794364745417}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c87926b8001HIz2lQXn1f9pPr","sessionID":"ses_e37936048ffeH8FUfoum56bQ5v","messageID":"msg_1c878fd79001yMds7MLPms6bbo"}}
